        <p source="#source-30625-30672"><seg source="#source-30625-30634">三十日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-30634-30672" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(4)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=4"><seg source="#source-30664-30672">斎藤</seg></seg></p>
